This is my public asset library for Blender 5.2.0 (currently in Beta). It's in
heavy work-in-progress state, so many things are yet to be implemented.

The goal is to fill in as many creative assets as possible, while retaining
rich presentation to ultimately make Blender more fun to work with.

My own motivation is to create a library that holds all the things I've
created while experimenting in Blender. I love tinkering with it, but I'm yet
to find a niche that I want to be a part in. By creating this library, I'm
hoping to boost my creative itch and make archiving my own artwork possible.
